msgid ""
"pthread_tryjoin_np, pthread_timedjoin_np - try to join with a terminated "
"thread"
msgstr ""
"pthread_tryjoin_np, pthread_timedjoin_np - încearcă să unească cu un fir ce "
"s-a terminat de executat"

